      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1935072456399798446",
      "text": "[9:23PM] #Ogolonto #TrafficUpdate \n\nSmooth traffic flow from Itanwolo inward Majindu, although a minor delay is experienced approaching Ogoloto intersection due to traffic interchange. However, immediately after Ogoloto, traffic movement improves significantly inward Agric and continues through to Haruno. \nA similar smooth movement is observed on the return journey from Haruno to Itanwolo.\nGood traffic movement on the route connecting Ogoloto to Obasekumade, inward Ferry Terminal, encompassing Ebute Police Post, General Hospital, Ojogbe, Ita Elewa, and environs.\nUnencumbered traffic flow from Ebute inward Ibese Roundabout, down to Igbogbo, with no notable congestion.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
