      "text": "[9:36PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nSteady and smooth vehicular movement observed from Badagry Roundabout, connecting Joseph Dosu Way, down to Badagry Market, with traffic flowing optimally.\nUnimpeded traffic flow on the return journey from Badagry Market to Badagry Roundabout, encompassing Ibereko, Aradagun, Mowo, Age Mowo, Elijah, Ile Epo, en route Oko Afo, down to Magbon, Ibiye Odofa, Morogbo, and back to Agbara, with both outbound and return journeys experiencing fluid movement.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
